  "notes": "Google says the stable gemini-2.5-flash-lite is the same underlying model as the 06-17 preview and planned to remove the preview alias on 2025-08-25; the release notes of 2025-11-04 announced the shutdown of gemini-2.5-flash-lite-preview-06-17 for 2025-11-18. The 09-2025 preview (shutdown announced for 2026-03-31; the model page lists it as shut down) was not intended to become a new stable version, so it is kept as an alias and milestone, not as a separate record. Vertex AI is counted as Google's own API (api)."
